graph TD
    subgraph Host NAS Environment
        A["/ufi/pool-raw/syspool/Books"] -->|Mounts to /books| B(mylibrary_scanner Container)
        C["/ufi/pool-raw/syspool/audiobooks"] -->|Mounts to /audiobooks| B
        D["./nas_scanner/config.json"] -->|Mounts to /config/config.json| B
        E["./nas_scanner/scanner_state.db"] -->|Mounts to /app/scanner_state.db| B
    end

    subgraph Container Execution Loop
        B -->|1. Start Loop| F{docker_scanner_loop.py}
        F -->|Runs| G[sync_files.py]
        F -->|Runs| H[sync_audiobooks.py]
        F -->|Runs| I[sync_calibre.py]
    end

    subgraph Central Application
        G -->|1. POST sync to /api/sync/file/| J(mylibrary_web Container)
        G -.->|2. POST cleanup to /api/sync/cleanup/| J
        H -->|1. POST sync to /api/sync/file/| J
        H -.->|2. POST cleanup to /api/sync/cleanup/| J
        I -->|1. POST sync to /api/sync/file/| J
        I -.->|2. POST cleanup to /api/sync/cleanup/| J
        J -->|Database Inserts & Deletions| K[(PostgreSQL / SQLite Database)]
    end
